    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27013" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lōtĭum</span></b> ,
		ĭi, n., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>urine</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">brassica alvum bonam facit lotiumque,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 156</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Suet. Vesp. 23</span></i>.—Prov.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">non valet lotium suum, of a good-for-nothing
					fellow,</span>”
